Z||000000||Joe Torma||08-02-2001||12:10 PM||||Ok, so I'm not happy with my boxes taking up so much room... I've seen Fierosound's website and pics all over the forum...but I have never seen the driver's side hole.  Can anyone give me dimensions or a good picture of the hole and the fuel filler and whatever else is in the way?  I'd like to know what I'm getting into, and if my speakers are going to fit.<P>Thanks in advance,<BR>Joe||||reg||1
Z||000001||Oreif||08-02-2001||12:36 PM||||Here are the detail pics of Coyote's car. Hope these help. NOTE: on the drivers side the top right corner of the area has the fuel filler pipe. So you need to be careful and not cut into it.<P>The pics are of the passenger side.<P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Subhole.jpg">  <P>------------------<BR>       <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/LOGO3.jpg">     <BR><B><I>Got Emblems?</I></B><p>[This message has been edited by Oreif (edited 08-02-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000002||Joe Torma||08-02-2001||01:06 PM||||Thanks Oreif...helps a bit.  Looks like a 6-7" square hole.  Do you think it can get another inch all the way around?<P>Oh yeah, how do I get some emblems from you?<P>Joe<p>[This message has been edited by Joe Torma (edited 08-02-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000003||Oreif||08-02-2001||01:27 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Joe Torma:<BR><B><P>Oh yeah, how do I get some emblems from you?<P>Joe<P>[This message has been edited by Joe Torma (edited 08-02-2001).]</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><BR>I'm not sure how much bigger you can go on the hole. It's Coyote's car and he did all the cutting. I just have pics.<BR>As for emblems, Just Email me at se1986@home.com<BR>||||reg||1
